<span id="A1.T8.2.30.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.30.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Requirements:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.31" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.31.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T8.2.31.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.31.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Label every claim exactly once</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.32" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.32.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T8.2.32.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.32.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Use only the three specified labels</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.33" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.33.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T8.2.33.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.33.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Maintain the original claim count</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.34" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.34.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T8.2.34.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.34.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Return only the labeled, ordered list (no explanations)</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.35" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.35.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.T8.2.35.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.T8.2.35.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Below is your task.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.36" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.36.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T8.2.37" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T8.2.37.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
