<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Prompt for ranking subclaims by <span id="A1.T8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">query importance</span> and importance labeling. The LLM assigns each subclaim with a “vital”, “okay”, or “less-important” label independent of corectness.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.T9" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T9.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Query</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T9.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt" colspan="3">In a paragraph, could you answer: who wrote i want to dance with somebody by whitney houston</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T9.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T9.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T9.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:28.5pt;">
<span id="A1.T9.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T9.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Type</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T9.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:14.2pt;">
<span id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Index</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T9.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T9.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:54.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T9.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Importance</span></span>
