<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Example subclaim rankings for a query from <span id="A1.T9.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">NQ</span>. Normal responses highlight correct vital subclaims, while wrong responses show incorrect, but still vital subclaims.</figcaption>
